**.subckt test_GRADIENT
V1 VEXC GND 5
V2 VDD1 GND 5
V6 VDD2 GND 5
x2 S1N S1P VDD1 X1 S2N Y1 Z1 S2P GND S3N S3P GRADIENT
x3 S1N S1P VDD2 X2 S2N Y2 Z2 S2P GND S3N S3P GRADIENT2
R1 VEXC S2P r=' 1meg*(1-v(by)) '
R2 VEXC S2N r=' 1meg*(1+v(by)) '
R3 S2P GND r=' 1meg*(1+v(by)) '
R4 S2N GND r=' 1meg*(1-v(by)) '
V3 VDD3 GND 5
V4 VDD4 GND 5
R5 VEXC S3P r=' 1meg*(1-v(bz)) '
R6 VEXC S3N r=' 1meg*(1+v(bz)) '
R7 S3P GND r=' 1meg*(1+v(bz)) '
R8 S3N GND r=' 1meg*(1-v(bz)) '
R9 VEXC S1P r=' 1meg*(1-v(bx)) '
R10 VEXC S1N r=' 1meg*(1+v(bx)) '
R11 S1P GND r=' 1meg*(1+v(bx)) '
R12 S1N GND r=' 1meg*(1-v(bx)) '
